I think that overall, the game *is* easier after a first win, because 
you've seen all the levels and you've done it once, so it doesn't seem 
so impossible. But I've also found that immediately after an ascension, 
I tend to play badly in the opening stages of a game, because I've 
forgotten just how vulnerable low level characters are and how 
cautiously you have to play them.

Of course, it also depends somewhat on how lucky your first ascension 
was. If, for example, you got an early wish from fountain quaffing, you 
may be focused on getting that extra boost again, and not realize that 
overall you're losing many more characters by doing that than you would 
by avoiding fountains altogether.

